   "text": "STUDY · PROPHETS"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h1",
   "text": "The prophets, in order."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Every prophet and prophetess the Bible names, placed by the king Scripture says they served under — and the false prophets the text condemns. The sixteen whose books bear their names are marked."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "text": "IN THIS COLLECTION"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Choose a starting point. Explore in any order."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3",
   "text": "Everyone in the Bible"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Every person Scripture names, in the order of its history, and who each one was."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3",
   "text": "People & families"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Find a person, follow their family, and read the verses that name them."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3",
   "text": "Prophets through time"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Follow the prophets by era and the kings Scripture names beside them."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3",
   "text": "Rulers through time"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Judges, kings, queens, governors and emperors in the order of their reigns, beside the empires of the day, with the prophets who stood before them."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3",
   "text": "The apostles"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "The Twelve, Paul and the wider circle of the first church: where each was called, where they went, and how their stories end."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "text": "Voices through time."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "From Moses to the church in Acts: every prophet Scripture names, on the river of its history, with the kings they stood before."
  },
