   "text": "Haggai"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "A prophet who encouraged the rebuilding of the temple."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "In the days of Darius — Haggai 1:1"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Read Haggai"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "PROPHET · WROTE A BOOK"
  },
  {
